                                                "sense_id": "d1585f1c-9a93-3160-a6d0-c36163989172",
                                                "text": "Here Nessim would sit night after night in the winter, dressed in his old rust-coloured abba, staring gravely at Betelgeuse, or hovering over books of calculations for all the world like a medieval soothsayer."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
